WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.985
Today's words start with a quick sound.

2
00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:05.649
Some sounds can be held for a long time. Like these.

3
00:00:09.439 --> 00:00:11.801
Some sounds are quick. You cannot hold them.

4
00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:18.663
Keep a quick sound tiny. Never add an extra sound after it.

5
00:00:19.113 --> 00:00:24.927
So your child says the quick sound and goes straight into the next one. Then adds the last sound.

6
00:00:27.965 --> 00:00:29.004
The word is tap.

7
00:00:29.904 --> 00:00:33.999
Build the first row together. Then your child reads the words with dots.

8
00:00:34.449 --> 00:00:39.597
Last, your child says the word for each picture, and writes one sound in each box.
